does find some sort of an offer, there is a buyer

210
00:10:41,643 --> 00:10:46,149
市场随后再次向上延伸，再次注意发生了什么
Market then extends again, higher to the upside. And again, note what happens.

214
00:10:46,350 --> 00:10:48,150
低点处有非常浓重的阴影
Really dark shading at the low.

215
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:50,226
我们可以看到这些买家
We can see these buyers,

216
00:10:50,226 --> 00:10:52,965
不断将买价抬高
constantly lifting those bids higher and higher

217
00:10:56,488 --> 00:10:59,227
这个过程持续不断
This process just continues on and on.

218
00:10:59,430 --> 00:11:04,447
我们可以看到市场继续分步向上推进
We can see the market continues its stepwise move to the upside.

219
00:11:04,447 --> 00:11:08,209
检查模板时，注意延伸
When you go through your templates, note the extension.

222
00:11:08,450 --> 00:11:11,510
有时会出现相对激进的延伸
Sometimes you’re going to get relatively aggressive extensions.

223
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:16,610
有些市场在第一次回调后会激进延伸
Some markets tend to extend quite aggressively on that first pullback, after that first pullback.

225
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:19,483
有些市场则会给你
And some of them tend to give you

226
00:11:19,483 --> 00:11:21,629
更多阶梯式上涨
a little bit more of a stepwise

227
00:11:21,629 --> 00:11:25,309
就像我们在E-Mini S&P中看到的例子
as we’ve seen in this example in the E-Mini S&Ps.

229
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:30,190
风险方面，我们在95.5区域做多
In terms of risk, we were long around that 95.5 area.

230
00:11:30,970 --> 00:11:32,007
现在止损位移至98.5
We’re now trailing at 98.5—

231
00:11:32,007 --> 00:11:33,459
所以上涨了3点
so, good three handles to the upside,

232
00:11:33,459 --> 00:11:35,326
3到4点，止损设置相对紧凑
three to four handles with a relatively tight stop.

233
00:11:44,425 --> 00:11:46,706
当然，你可以移动止损，也应该移动止损
Of course, you can trail the stop, and you should trail the stop.

235
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:52,703
但同样，你也要确保
But equally, you also want to make sure

236
00:11:52,703 --> 00:11:54,136
别把止损设得太紧
that you’re not keeping it too tight,

237
00:11:54,136 --> 00:11:56,466
否则会在主动性驱动结束前被止损出局
so you end up getting stopped out before all the initiative is over.

238
00:11:56,470 --> 00:12:05,598
目标方面，我会说，持多头直到市场给你平仓理由
In terms of a target, as I say, stay long until the market Gives you a reason to get out.

242
00:12:05,598 --> 00:12:09,328
我认为我们可以在波段上清楚看到
What I would say is we can very clearly see on the rotations,

243
00:12:11,230 --> 00:12:13,230
回调时再次出现买盘吸收
Again, buying absorption on the pullback.

244
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:15,530
回调时再次出现买盘吸收
Again, buying absorption on the pullback.

245
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:20,175
所以对我来说，如果突破其中一个区域
So, for me, if we were to take out one of those regions,

246
00:12:20,175 --> 00:12:21,604
比如在10:07跌破25.10
say below this 25.10, by 10:07,

247
00:12:21,604 --> 00:12:28,395
我会锁定利润平仓，确保一笔漂亮的获胜交易
I’d be looking to lock in the profits and get out and secure a very decent winner. Okay.

249
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:31,656
这就是主动性驱动的案例
That then is our example of the initiative drive.

250
00:12:31,656 --> 00:12:35,275
和往常一样，去更新你的笔记
As usual, go and make some updates to your notes.

251
00:12:35,275 --> 00:12:37,808
